<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: killed a child -->
  <KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.label>matou uma criança</KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.label>
  <!-- EN: Killing one so young feels wrong, no matter the situation. -->
  <KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.description>Matar um tão jovem sente-se errado, não importa a situação.</KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.description>
  <!-- EN: killed my birth mother -->
  <KilledMyBirthMother.stages.killed_my_birth_mother.label>matou a minha mãe biológica</KilledMyBirthMother.stages.killed_my_birth_mother.label>
  <!-- EN: my birth mother {0} died -->
  <MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.label>minha mãe biológica {0} morreu</MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.label>
  <!-- EN: My birth mother died. She's gone forever. It's like a hole in my life. -->
  <MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.description>A minha mãe biológica morreu. Ela desapareceu para sempre. É como um buraco na minha vida.</MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.description>
  <!-- EN: my birth mother {0} lost -->
  <MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.label>a minha mãe biológica perdeu</MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.label>
  <!-- EN: My birth mother has been lost. I hope she will get back to us someday. -->
  <MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.description>A minha mãe biológica foi perdida. Espero que ela volte para nós um dia.</MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.description>
</LanguageData>
